ead more like it on the Game Developer Blogs.\n\n","target":"https://www.gamedeveloper.com/keyword/blogs","line":12},{"title":"Game Developer logo in a gray background | Game Developer","target":"https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt740a130ae3c5d529/blt2c2f608b8dadcd62/6a97e133db31b5be7767f1c7/GDE27_Placeholder_-_5.png?width=1280&auto=webp&quality=80&disable=upscale \"Game Developer\"","line":20,"embedded":true},{"title":"Rue89","target":"https://rue89.nouvelobs.com/blog/extension-du-domaine-du-jeu/2016/02/02/jai-cherche-une-definition-du-jeu-pendant-seize-ans-et-jai-enfin-trouve-235197","line":26}],"metadata":{"title":"How I found a definition of games after searching for 16 years.","source":"https://www.gamedeveloper.com/design/how-i-found-a-definition-of-games-after-searching-for-16-years-","author":["[[Oscar Barda]]"],"published":"2016-10-12","created":"2026-11-12","description":"Finding a definition for “games” or “play” is a very perilous exercise, but a very important one. This is why despite this topic having been a dead horse for decades, I decided to beat it once more, trying to lay a new brick on the edifice.","tags":["#clippings"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"Clippings/How I found a definition of games after searching for 16 years.md"},
